  "system": {
    "active": true,
    "description": "<p>When you take damage, you can take a Reaction to give yourself Resistance to that damage and any other damage of the same type until the end of the current turn.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-9xLaYNr0fhUQLYuZ\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This feature includes an Active Effect for resisting each type of damage which can be applied to get the relevant resistance. Be sure you disable/delete the previous Active Effect in the \"Effects\" tab of your sheet when you change Resistances.</p></section>",
